'''2.''' A name sometimes given to pyroxene, from its being found in ejected blocks and lavas.—'''Vulcanite flask,''' {{smaller|an iron box closed by screw-bolts, for holding an artificial denture while being vulcanized, to fix the artificial teeth in the vulcanite plate. The flask is heated in a vulcanizing furnace.}}

